            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Pasteback 0.4.1 — C++ code previews / C++ 代码预览

C++ syntax highlighting, line numbers, monospaced text and horizontal scrolling. Automatically detects common C++ snippets; choose C++ or Plain text manually when needed. Follows the Mac's light/dark appearance. Preserves original indentation and clipboard content; tabs display at four spaces. Long code previews are bounded; Copy All still copies the full original.

C++ 语法高亮、行号、等宽字体与横向滚动；自动识别常见代码，也可手动切换 C++ / 纯文本。适配明暗外观，保留原始空格、缩进和复制内容，Tab 按四空格宽度显示。长代码限制预览长度，复制全部保留完整原文。
]]></description>
